.TH OMAVRYTHINGD 8 "2026-10-11" "omavrything 0.1.3" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
omavrythingd \- index-backed file search daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B omavrythingd
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B omavrythingd
keeps an in-memory index of the mounted filesystems and answers search
queries over a Unix domain socket. It discovers roots from the mount table
(or from explicit
.B \-\-root
arguments), scans them in parallel, keeps the index current with
.BR inotify ,
runs idle-gated periodic rescans, and persists a snapshot for warm starts.
.PP
Queries are served as newline-delimited JSON over the socket. Control and
status are exposed on the system D-Bus under
.BR tech.alatcerdas.omavrything .
.PP
The daemon is normally started by
.BR systemd (1)
as the
.B omavrythingd.service
unit, running as the unprivileged
.B omavrything
user with only the minimal capability set it needs.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-config \fIpath\fR
Configuration file (default:
.IR /etc/omavrything/config.toml ).
.TP
.B \-\-no-config
Ignore the configuration file.
.TP
.B \-\-root \fIdir\fR
Directory to index. Repeatable. Defaults to
.IR $HOME .
.TP
.B \-\-auto
Discover roots from the mount table, skipping pseudo filesystems.
.TP
.B \-\-exclude \fIglob\fR
Exclude glob, for example
.RB ' **/.git/** '.
Repeatable.
.TP
.B \-\-no-watch
Disable inotify live updates.
.TP
.B \-\-scan-interval \fIsecs\fR
Idle-gated rescan interval in seconds (0 disables; default 900).
.TP
.B \-\-socket \fIpath\fR
Unix socket path. Defaults to
.I /run/omavrything/omavrything.sock
as root, otherwise
.IR $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/omavrything.sock .
.TP
.B \-\-snapshot \fIpath\fR
Snapshot path. Defaults to
.I /var/lib/omavrything/index.snapshot
as root, otherwise
.IR $XDG_STATE_HOME/omavrything/index.snapshot .
.TP
.B \-\-no-snapshot
Disable snapshot persistence.
.TP
.B \-\-snapshot-interval \fIsecs\fR
Snapshot write interval in seconds (0 disables; default 300).
.TP
.B \-\-evict-idle-secs \fIsecs\fR
Idle period in seconds after which the index is evicted to its snapshot
image, falling back to a small resident delta (0 disables; default 20).
Idle means no queries and no user-driven mutations; filesystem events
never reset the timer.
.TP
.B \-\-no-dbus
Disable the D-Bus control interface.
.TP
.B \-\-no-ntfs
Disable NTFS partition detection and indexing.
.TP
.B \-\-no-metadata
Skip per-file size and mtime stats (names only; faster scan).
.TP
.B \-\-log-level \fIlevel\fR
Log level: error, warn, info, debug, or trace (default: error).
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show the version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/omavrything/config.toml
Base configuration.
.TP
.I /var/lib/omavrything/index.snapshot
Persisted index snapshot for warm starts.
.TP
.I /var/lib/omavrything/config.toml
State written by the daemon (for example, remembered NTFS mounts).
.TP
.I /run/omavrything/omavrything.sock
Unix socket for the search hot path.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR omavry (1),
.BR systemctl (1)
